Document
  Frontmatter format=Yaml
    Mapping
      Pair key=description
        Scalar String "Report \"what changed since the caller last touched a managed file\" across the vault. Surfaces comments, acks, edits, and sandbox-adds per file. Read-only — never mutates."
  MarkdownBlock
    Section
      Heading
        Text "/remargin:activity [path]"
      Paragraph
        Line
          Text "Run "
          Code "mcp__remargin__activity"
          Text " to report what changed since the caller last acted on each managed "
          Code ".md"
          Text " file under "
          Code "path"
          Text " (defaults to cwd). Use this at the start of a session, or whenever the agent needs to notice what happened while it was away and decide whether to react."
      Section
        Heading
          Text "Steps"
        List start=1 loose
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Strong
                      Text "Invoke the activity tool."
                    Text " Call "
                    Code "mcp__remargin__activity"
                    Text " with "
                    Code "path"
                    Text " (the argument, or omit for cwd) and "
                    Code "pretty: true"
                    Text ". Do not pass "
                    Code "since"
                    Text " unless the user explicitly asked for a specific cutoff — the default per-file caller-last-action cutoff is the point of this tool."
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Strong
                      Text "Surface the output verbatim."
                    Text " Paste the pretty-printed activity timeline into the response. Do not paraphrase, summarize, or reformat."
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Strong
                      Text "Decide whether to react."
                    Text " After surfacing the output, briefly call out anything actionable: comments addressed to the caller that are pending, edits on files the caller is staging, sandbox-adds by other identities the caller might want to look at. Keep this short — one or two sentences. The user (or the next agent step) decides what to do with it."
      Section
        Heading
          Text "Constraints"
        List
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Text "Read-only. Never mutate state from this command."
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Text "Do not hand-roll the cutoff from "
                    Code "comments"
                    Text " / "
                    Code "query"
                    Text " — those don't compute the per-file caller-last-action cutoff and don't fold edits / re-sandboxes into the same change list. "
                    Code "activity"
                    Text " is the only correct tool for this question."
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Text "If the user gave a "
                    Code "path"
                    Text " argument that resolves outside any remargin realm, surface the tool's error directly. Don't try to recover by searching adjacent directories."
          Item
            MarkdownBlock
              Section
                Paragraph
                  Line
                    Text "If "
                    Code "pretty: true"
                    Text " output is empty, that's the correct answer: \"nothing new since you last acted in this path.\""
